              "name": "BARNKITTY"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Such a wonderful soup. We diced up a small onion and two cloves of garlic and sauteed these in 1T butter before adding the cider and all else (leaving out the water), with 1t dried thyme. We also substituted one 14oz can of (whole) corn for the frozen and 12oz can of evaporated milk."
